+
+- [#93](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/pull/93) [`a7faee0`](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/commit/a7faee013da49aa8415bad2da9f58be26e093fab) Thanks [@PazChen](https://github.com/PazChen)! - Studio: ⌥-drag copies, paste, ⌥←/→ and a start time typed in the inspector no longer cut clips. A copy or paste lands on a new track when its spot is taken; a nudge stops against the next clip. A new track opens above a picture track and below a sound track, so the track you pointed at keeps its number.
