 - [#26](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/pull/26) [`e0a80d5`](https://github.com/openfilm/openfilm/commit/e0a80d515fa13457ece08925575d5453c0b0fc6d) Thanks [@PazChen](https://github.com/PazChen)! - Studio: the timeline no longer offers fixed transitions. A click or right-click on a cut opens no menu (dragging it still rolls the cut), and a clip's menu has no "transition at its start / end". Transitions are your agent's to write; ones a film already has are still drawn, and can be made longer or shorter or removed. Fade in and fade out stay in the clip's menu.
 
